# Depth Anything V2 Large, converted to Core ML (~640 MB).
#
# Not committed: it is a build artifact of scripts/convert_coreml.py in the
# python repo, and it is CC-BY-NC-4.0 — fine for research and TestFlight, but
# not something to redistribute through this repository.
#
# Regenerate with:
#   conda run -n coreml python scripts/convert_coreml.py --shapes multifunction
# then copy the .mlpackage and out/coreml/pos_embed/base_1x1370x1024.f32 into
# 2DConverterApp/Resources/.
2DConverterApp/Resources/*.mlpackage/
2DConverterApp/Resources/*.f32

# SwiftPM build products
ReliefKit/.build/
.swiftpm/

# opencv2.xcframework IS committed (~93 MB, largest single file 44.7 MB).
#
# Without it the package cannot even resolve -- "local binary target 'opencv2'
# does not contain a binary artifact" -- so a clone would not build at all.
# Every file is under GitHub's 100 MB limit, and it is rebuilt rarely enough
# that the history will not grow. Recipe: ReliefKit/Frameworks/BUILD_OPENCV.md
